# CGMI Church Plus — Anniversary Quiz App

## PROJECT OVERVIEW
Build a full-stack church quiz web app for CGMI Church Plus, Benin City.
Participants scan a QR code, land on the site, answer 20 questions in 
Typeform style (one question per screen), and results are saved to a 
Supabase database. There is a password-protected admin dashboard showing 
a live podium (1st, 2nd, 3rd place), full leaderboard, and a review 
section showing every participant's answers vs correct answers.

---

## TECH STACK
- Next.js 14 (App Router)
- Tailwind CSS
- Supabase (database + auth for admin login)
- Deploy on Vercel

