## QUIZ FLOW — PARTICIPANT SIDE

### Screen 1: Welcome Page (/)
- Display church logo at top
- Church name: "CGMI Church Plus"
- Subtitle: "Anniversary Quiz"
- Tagline: "Changed by God's Word to Change Our World"
- Large button: "Start Quiz →"
- Navy background (#0A1628), gold accents (#D4AF37)

### Screen 2: Name Entry
- Heading: "What is your name?"
- Single text input, large, centered
- Placeholder: "Enter your full name"
- Button: "Begin Quiz →"
- On submit:
  - Validate name is not empty
  - Call POST /api/start-session with { participant_name }
  - Server creates a session row, returns session_id
  - Store session_id in React state (not localStorage)
  - Navigate to first question

### Screens 3–22: Questions (one per screen)
- Progress bar at very top: "Question X of 20" with filled bar
- Countdown timer below progress bar: starts at 0:40, counts down
- Timer text turns red and pulses (CSS animation) when under 10 seconds
- Question text: large, centered, readable
- 4 answer options displayed as large tappable buttons
  - Min height: 56px
  - Full width on mobile
  - Navy border, white background by default
  - On tap: highlight selected option in gold, disable all other options
  - Do NOT reveal correct/wrong answer yet (that happens in review)
- On option selected:
  - Call POST /api/submit-answer immediately with:
    { session_id, question_number, question_text, selected_answer, correct_answer }
  - Server calculates is_correct and saves to answers table
  - Wait 1.5 seconds then auto-advance to next question
- If timer hits 0:00:
  - Call POST /api/submit-answer with selected_answer: null, is_correct: false
  - Show brief "Time's up!" flash
  - Auto-advance after 1 second
- Disable browser back button: use router.replace not router.push,
  and add a beforeunload warning
- No skipping forward or backward between questions

### Screen 23: Quiz Complete (/quiz/done)
- On reaching this screen: call POST /api/complete-quiz with { session_id }
- Server calculates final score, total_time_seconds, updates session,
  recalculates positions for all completed sessions
- Display:
  - Checkmark animation
  - "You're done! 🎉"
  - Participant's name
  - "Your answers have been submitted."
  - "Stay tuned — results will be announced shortly!"
- Do NOT show their score here

