## WINNER / RANKING LOGIC — SERVER SIDE ONLY

In /api/complete-quiz:

1. Calculate score by counting is_correct = true in answers table 
   for this session_id
2. Calculate total_time_seconds = completed_at - started_at
3. Update sessions row: score, total_time_seconds, is_complete = true, 
   completed_at = now()
4. Re-rank ALL completed sessions:
   - ORDER BY score DESC, total_time_seconds ASC
   - Assign position = 1 to highest scorer (fastest if tied on score)
   - Assign position = 2 to next
   - Assign position = 3 to next
   - If two participants have identical score AND identical time, 
     they share the same position number
5. Update position column for all completed sessions

Rules:
- No minimum score required — there is ALWAYS a winner
- 80% (16/20) is a "Gold Achiever" badge only, not a requirement
- Score is NEVER sent from frontend — only raw answers are submitted
- Rankings update live every time someone completes the quiz

