## SECURITY & ANTI-CHEAT RULES
1. Score is calculated server-side ONLY — frontend never sends a score
2. Answers are submitted one at a time as the participant goes 
   (not all at once at the end — prevents bulk manipulation)
3. Timer is enforced: if completed_at - started_at is under 
   (question_count × 5 seconds), flag the session in the dashboard 
   with a ⚠️ warning icon — admin can investigate before announcing winner
4. Browser back button disabled on quiz pages using router.replace 
   and a window beforeunload event listener
5. Options disabled immediately on selection — no double submitting
6. Each session has a unique UUID — cannot reuse someone else's session
7. Admin dashboard fully protected by Supabase Auth middleware
8. RLS ensures participants can never read other participants' data